lute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc%2FDragon%20Lair\">PoH Dragon Lair</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32775,32269,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32775, 32269, 7)</a>) on the way to the <a href=\"#/quest/ornamented-shield-quest\">Ornamented Shield Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">PoI</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Dragon Lair</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32787,32336,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32787, 32336, 12)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Dragon%20Lair\">Thais Dragon Lair</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32358,32094,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32358, 32094, 10)</a>) on the way to the <a href=\"#/quest/naginata-quest\">Naginata Quest</a>. The <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">special task</a> teleport is located inside the <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc%2FDragon%20Lair\">PoH Dragon Lair</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32769,32290,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32769, 32290, 10)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\t Demodras will retreat at 300  (6.67%, red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p> <b>Mages:</b> Get a good blocker, and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death%20Rune\">Sudden Death Runes</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle%20Rune\">Icicle Runes</a> if your level and magic level are high enough. Otherwise, bring a <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin</a> or other Mages for back-up. A Mage or Paladin may attempt the special task at level 100 with reasonable success. Paladins will probably not need <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a>. <br/><b>Knights:</b> It is possible to solo this creature with good skills and high level using <a href=\"#/wiki/Fierce%20Berserk\">Fierce Berserk</a>. It is advised to attempt the special task on at least level 130 when you can use Ultimate Healing Potions.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 120 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Claw\"><img alt=\"Dragon Claw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Claw_a2185a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Claw\">Dragon Claw</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:cen